e Companion App to really boost your couch gaming session!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2477010/extras/36573127294df9f72b0780dbe2aca1e0.poster.avif?t=1753183298\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2477010/extras/36573127294df9f72b0780dbe2aca1e0.webm?t=1753183298\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2477010/extras/36573127294df9f72b0780dbe2aca1e0.mp4?t=1753183298\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set up a game in async mode and play a game across multiple days.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2477010/extras/57aaae2a14c6af60d59a51ee56bdce83.poster.avif?t=1753183298\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2477010/extras/57aaae2a14c6af60d59a51ee56bdce83.webm?t=1753183298\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2477010/extras/57aaae2a14c6af60d59a51ee56bdce83.mp4?t=1753183298\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powered by an innovative adaptive AI system, single-player mode offers a challenge for new and experienced players alike.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2477010/extras/6fcab17c6de2cadf9ad35593c768fc36.poster.avif?t=1753183298\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2477010/extras/6fcab17c6de2cadf9ad35593c768fc36.webm?t=